# Kastral, the Windcrested and Coast Watcher (Birds) both connect with Bot2 in the same combat damage step: "one or more Birds you
# control deal combat damage to a player" triggers once (CR 603.2c), so one mode is chosen and each Bird gets one +1/+1 counter,
# not two. "Put a +1/+1 counter on each Bird you control" (CR 608.2c, 122.1) leaves Bot1's Balduvian Bears and Bot2's own Coast
# Watcher alone.
